  XMM home with a save/restore around each cold call, never over the
  call's own result (RA-XMM-CALL-SPANNING-SPILL, COLD-SPLIT-DEAD-SAVE;
  CCC_NO_COLD_CALL_SPLIT);
* relay_and_lea: %rbp copies are relayed in frameless functions on
  `rbp_is_gpr_in_function` evidence, never %rsp (PEEP-RELAY-RBP-GPR,
  3 tests; zstd_count 101.60M -> 97.41M Ir).
  A cast follow-hint was tried and removed by measurement (RA-CAST-HINT).

