  -fmath-errno with an inline sqrtsd and a never-taken `call sqrt` slow
  path, GCC's shape (MATH-ERRNO-SQRT; regression
  math_errno_sqrt_slow_path);
* x86 FP `==`/`!=` branches and selects fuse to ucomisd + jp/jne
  instead of materialising setcc pairs; `invert_jcc` is a closed match
  instead of a silent wrong-direction default;
* loop_idiom: popcount loop recognition tightened
