  (AArch64, deduplicated w/x), simplify_mul_high / sdiv_by_minus_one,
  cast_is_operand_identity, IdiomCarriers::all_dead_after_cmov,
  encode_cfi_insn. Output-neutral: 727 corpus files byte-identical.
- Documented CCC_NO_FOLD_ADDR_DEFER, CCC_NO_RDX_PARAM_HOMES and the
