`__m128` temporary produces exactly that shape (`_mm_div_ps` printed
garbage in agg_fwd_param_home / simd_sse_float /
builtin_ia32_vector_value once the two-register carrier fold exposed the
lane copies to SLP). Flushing is always sound; the cost is one store that
was owed anyway.

